  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This frog is rated beginner because all the main pieces are spheres or simple capsules. Work the larger body sphere first, then the smaller head sphere. The raised eye bulges sit on top of the head and each contains a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "safety-eyes-fr"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "safety eye"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". All pieces start with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-fr"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Yarn and yarn amounts"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You need approx. 30 g of bright green DK and a small amount of white for the eye surround."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work a 9 cm sphere (24 rounds). Stuff with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "stuffing-fr"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "firm stuffing"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " before closing."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Head"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work a 8 cm sphere (21 rounds). Leave a larger opening before closing; the mouth is implied by the indented head-body join."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Eye bulges (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work a 2.5 cm sphere (6 rounds). Fit a safety eye before closing. Stuff lightly. Use "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-fr"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " rounds to close tightly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Back legs (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work a 2 cm diameter by 7 cm capsule (19 rounds). Bend the leg upward at the knee when attaching."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Front arms (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work a 1.5 cm diameter by 5 cm capsule (13 rounds)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sew head to body front using "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "ladder-stitch-fr"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "ladder stitch"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Place eye bulges on the head crown with a small gap between them. Attach back legs to the body sides bent at 90 degrees. Attach front arms below the head."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What to try next"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The amigurumi chameleon uses a similar oval head with a much longer body shape."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}